## User

Remove duplicates from a list, keeping the first occurrence of each element.

## Type

type
```lean
def dedup (l : List ℕ) : List ℕ
```

## Term

```lean
l.map (· + 1)
```

## lean

## lean


```lean
by
  simp only [List.map_cons, List.cons_append, List.nil_append]
  exact dedup l
```

